tle\">Experiences that<br><em>stay with you<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"testi-grid\">\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-text\">The therapist was very kind and welcoming. Everything from the decor to the lighting and music was thoughtfully curated. We left feeling relaxed and rejuvenated \u2014 truly unforgettable.<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-name\">Kinuthia<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-text\">She makes you feel like you're floating. Her incredible technique and warmth create an environment that is both professional and deeply welcoming. We will definitely return.<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-name\">Larissa G.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"testi-card\">\n        <div class=\"testi-stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<\/div>\n        <p class=\"testi-text\">The dedication she puts into her work is extraordinary. You feel completely taken care of from the moment you walk in. An experience we would recommend to every couple.<\/p>\n        <p class=\"testi-name\">Fern\u00e3o O.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<section class=\"faq\" id=\"faq\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Your questions, answered<\/div>\n    <h2 class=\"title\">Everything you need to know<br><em>before you book<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"faq-inner\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Do we receive the massage at the same time?<span>+<\/span><\/div>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Both partners receive their massage simultaneously in the same private space. You experience it together, side by side.<\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-q\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">Is it